<title>USA: MHM Services doesn't meet listing standard.</title>
<headline>MHM Services doesn't meet listing standard.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>MHM Services Inc said on Tuesday that it currently does not meet the financial guidelines for continued listing on the American Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company also said H. Scott Miller and Michael Sandler have resigned from its board. Both men are also directors of MEDIQ Inc, MHM said.</p>
<p>MHM said it is reviewing with its counsel the validity of its $11.5 million promissory note to MEDIQ due in 1998.</p>
</text>
